 {
  "from": "agent (Priya, Cedar Ridge FCU)",
  "time": "2026-09-14 08:20",
  "text": "Done: card 5530 is cancelled and a replacement is on its way to your address on file (5-7 business days). I've opened dispute DSP-0914-2231 for the three transactions and attached the liability section of your debit card agreement."
