 {
  "from": "system",
  "time": "2026-09-14 08:20",
  "text": "Attachment - Debit Card Agreement, section 9 (Your liability for unauthorized transfers): Tell us AT ONCE if you believe your card or PIN has been lost or stolen. If you tell us within 2 business days after you learn of the loss or theft of your card or PIN, you can lose no more than $50 if someone used your card or PIN without your permission. If you do NOT tell us within 2 business days after you learn of the loss or theft, and we can prove we could have stopped someone from using your card or PIN without your permission if you had told us, you could lose as much as $500. Visa Zero Liability: for purchases processed through the Visa network as signature, online or contactless transactions, your liability is $0; Zero Liability does not apply to ATM withdrawals or to PIN-based purchases. Locking your card in the mobile app counts as telling us."
 },
 {
  "from": "member",
  "time": "2026-09-14 08:24",
